Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Dynamic Data Lists|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Staging Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Staging Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Publishing
		|portlet|Staging|
	And Staging activate Staging CP
		|pageVersioningEnabled|true|
		|siteName|Staging Site Name|
	Then ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Staging Site Name|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Create Web Content Structure And Template
Priority: 3
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Manage Structures
	And WebContentStructures add CP
		|structureDescription|WC Structure Description|
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field
		|field|Text|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Text|
		|fieldName|Text|
	And WebContentStructures save CP
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Manage Structures
	And WebContentStructures view CP
		|structureDescription|WC Structure Description|
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Manage Templates
	And WebContentTemplates add CP
		|templateDescription|WC Template Description|
		|templateLanguage|ftl|
		|templateName|WC Template Name|
	And WebContentTemplates add Structure
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
		|templateFieldNames|Text|
		|templateLanguage|ftl|
	And WebContentTemplates save
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	Then WebContentTemplates view CP
		|templateDescription|WC Template Description|
		|templateLanguage|ftl|
		|templateName|WC Template Name|